        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wildcat Brook, Carter Notch, Bean's Purchase, Coos County, Jackson, Carroll County, Ellis River, New Hampshire\n- Topics: geography, population\n\nFacts:\n- Wildcat Brook rises at Carter Notch in Bean's Purchase in Coos County, New Hampshire.\n- Wildcat Brook flows south through Jackson in Carroll County, New Hampshire, to its confluence with the Ellis River near Jackson's southern boundary.\n- As of the 2010 census, Carroll County, New Hampshire, had a population of 47,818 and was the third-least populous county in New Hampshire.",
